				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">S. <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>P. <persName>Gabriell</persName>, amicus meus familiaris, salutem a te, humanissim<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>e <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, mihi impartiit simulque narravit te desideratissime <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>meas expectare literas, verum quum antehac nihil haberem script<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>u dignum, quid naeniis frivolisque commentis efficerem, ut bonas <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>dispenderes horas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Verum quum iam qualiscunque se obtulit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>occasio, silere non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Scripsit ad me D. <persName>Richardus</persName>, amicus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>mihi praecipuus tuique amantissimus, literas se accepisse, u<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>t tibi id significem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Otium scribendi non habuit; tum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>(quod ipse nosti) non libenter Latine scribit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Brevi tamen respons<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>urus est.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nova, quae scripsit, partim laeta partim tristissima <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>sunt: laeta, quod speratur aliquam saltem religionis emendatione<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>m futuram, licet non perfectam et absolutam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Interim tamen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sub nomine religionis et libertatis carnalem imitantur licentiam <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ipsi, qui evangelicissimi (ut ita loquar) velint esse; <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>omne genus vitii apud eos viget, proh dolor, praecipue adulterii <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>fornisationisque, quod peccatum (ut scribit) non ducunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nisi huius <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>mali correctio fiat, perimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Scripsissem plura; verum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>tabellio non sinit; instat enim.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Quare, quod reliquum est, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>per has literas inclusas <placeName ref="l830">Anglicas</placeName> ab <persName ref="p1560">Hopero</persName> versas inte<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>lliges.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad eum de victoria <placeName ref="l830">Anglorum</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName>, qua<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>liter civitatem potiti sint; spero eum tecum communicasse.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Nostra <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> manet ut antehac, falsoque sunt, quae de <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ea et episcopo feruntur.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Orate assidue pro nobis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Bene vale et saluta doctos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p506">Butlero</persName> quaeso <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>indicato <persName>Richardum</persName> literas etiam suas accepisse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>iterum.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Tuus <persName ref="p505">I[oan<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nes] B[urcherus</persName><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem fürnemmen wisen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>her <persName ref="p495">Heinrich Bullinger</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>praedicanten in dem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Münster, minem gun<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>stigen hern und freundt.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>HIER NICHT VERGESSEN Brief Nr. 19339 vom 26. Januar (<persName ref="p1278">Gast</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>) zu veröffentlichen!!!</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
